          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "sanduq-e post is built from sanduq 'chest, box', borrowed from Arabic ṣundūq (EtymDB), and post, a loan usually traced to French poste."
            }
