            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "در فرودگاه یک سیم کارت تازه خریدم. Dar forudgâh yek simkârt-e tâze kharidam. At the airport I bought a new SIM card."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Written like native sim 'wire' + kârt, but taken from English."
            }
          ]
        },
