              "text": "تماس گرفتن (tamâs gereftan) — \"to get in touch, to call (someone)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "با هتل تماس گرفتیم و اتاق را رزرو کردیم. Bâ hotel tamâs gereftim va otâq râ rezerv kardim. We called the hotel and booked the room."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person called takes bâ. More formal than zang zadan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "tamâs gereftan is built from tamâs 'contact', a loan usually traced to Arabic tamāss 'touching one another', and the native verb gereftan 'to take'. EtymDB does not list tamâs."
            }
          ]
        },
